From: arr-optimized <arr-optimized@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/8] Cache ffprobe results per file and stop hung ffprobe runs

Results are reused only while the file stamp (size, last write time and,
for a symlink, the final target path and its last write time) is unchanged
before and after the probe. The cache is bounded by entry count and by
estimated memory. A probe that runs longer than 5 minutes returns no media
info instead of blocking the import forever.
